<i>♪ Ooh, yeah ♪</i>
<i>♪ ໂອ້, ແມ່ນແລ້ວ ♪</i>

1512
01:37:05,083 --> 01:37:08,000
Saturday night in The Stone Pony,
ໃນຄືນວັນເສົາໃນ The Stone Pony,

1513
